WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.660
At the dawn of the Seika era,

00:02.660 --> 00:07.150
in order to ruh... regulate unwanted messages that presented a bad infloo... influence to society,

00:07.150 --> 00:10.600
the Media Cluh... Cleansing Act was passed.

00:10.600 --> 00:15.000
The libraries armed themselves in order to protect freedom of ex... expression

00:15.000 --> 00:17.530
from the extreme censorship of the Media Cleansing Committee.

00:17.530 --> 00:20.860
The conflict between the two con...

00:21.210 --> 00:22.840
Sir, how do you pronounce this?

00:24.250 --> 00:27.000
That's why I told you to take the lectures seriously!

00:33.030 --> 00:37.630
usu murasaki hirogaru

00:33.030 --> 00:37.630
The faint purple spreads across the sky

00:37.630 --> 00:45.610
orenji iro ni kawaru mado no soto

00:37.630 --> 00:45.610
The color changes to orange outside the window

00:45.610 --> 00:49.660
yoru wa mou bai bai

00:45.610 --> 00:49.660
The night's already "bye-bye"

00:50.210 --> 00:55.900
tada kirei na mono wo kirei to

00:50.210 --> 00:55.900
I just want to be someone who

00:55.900 --> 01:00.460
ieru atashi de itai

00:55.900 --> 01:00.460
calls beautiful things beautiful

01:00.460 --> 01:06.800
ima wa dokidoki shitai no

01:00.460 --> 01:06.800
I want to get excited for it!

01:07.330 --> 01:11.860
fumidashichae tomaranai

01:07.330 --> 01:11.860
So I step out, unstoppable

01:11.860 --> 01:16.450
zenbu te ni hairi sou de

01:11.860 --> 01:16.450
And take everything into my own hands

01:16.940 --> 01:21.050
sono saki de aitai

01:16.940 --> 01:21.050
Beyond there, I want to meet

01:21.050 --> 01:27.040
mita koto no nai atashi

01:21.050 --> 01:27.040
the new self that I've never seen

01:27.510 --> 01:32.160
sayonara daisuki na machi

01:27.510 --> 01:32.160
Farewell, my beloved town

01:32.160 --> 01:36.710
atashi mo ganbatte miru yo

01:32.160 --> 01:36.710
I'll try to do my best

01:36.710 --> 01:44.270
kono sora no tsuzuku basho de

01:36.710 --> 01:44.270
somewhere under the same sky

01:57.720 --> 01:59.710
That's really getting on my nerves.

01:59.710 --> 02:02.370
How many times are you—

02:02.370 --> 02:06.870
Tezuka, please ship me back to Tokyo in a package!

02:11.880 --> 02:16.330
Situation 10

02:11.880 --> 02:16.330
Homecoming Incidents

02:16.340 --> 02:21.770
Let me begin the mission briefing. Our mission is to protect a prefecture exhibit in Ibaragi.

02:21.770 --> 02:23.060
Ibaragi?

02:26.310 --> 02:28.510
Any problems?

02:29.270 --> 02:31.450
N-No, nothing at all.

02:32.140 --> 02:37.110
I can't stay calm when my house is within a five kilometer radius.

02:42.250 --> 02:43.910
The Cleansing Force's...

02:43.910 --> 02:47.050
This is this year's prize work.

02:48.870 --> 02:50.520
Freiheit.

02:50.520 --> 02:52.340
It's such a nice title.

02:59.450 --> 03:00.600
Yes?

03:00.600 --> 03:05.090
I heard that the Library Force in Ibaragi has had issues for a few years.

03:05.090 --> 03:08.220
Be careful, since it won't be an easy task.

03:08.220 --> 03:09.190
Thanks.

03:09.190 --> 03:10.600
I'll let everyone know.

03:10.600 --> 03:15.220
Anyway, how does your information network function?

03:15.220 --> 03:17.350
It's a trade secret.

03:17.350 --> 03:22.040
It's impossible to win an information battle against me, so don't even try.

03:22.040 --> 03:25.080
It never crossed my mind

03:25.080 --> 03:27.380
to try something so audacious.

03:27.380 --> 03:28.230
It's just...

03:29.040 --> 03:33.170
I thought I'd give you all the information I get from my brother.

03:33.170 --> 03:34.580
Thanks.

03:34.580 --> 03:36.960
I'll give you another call if I learn anything new.

03:36.960 --> 03:38.070
Later.

03:38.070 --> 03:38.980
Tezuka,

03:40.300 --> 03:44.010
I haven't received your payment for the Preferment Exam.

03:46.680 --> 03:49.470
I haven't forgotten about it. Don't worry.

03:49.470 --> 03:50.480
Later.

03:50.480 --> 03:53.690
Jeez, did you have to remind me now?

03:56.150 --> 03:59.860
I was telling you to come home safely, idiot.

04:04.600 --> 04:08.500
First Prefecture Library, Museum of Modern Art

04:15.650 --> 04:17.300
Are you the leader?

04:17.300 --> 04:19.420
Please surrender your weapons immediately.

04:19.420 --> 04:22.100
I don't care if you're the Non-Violence Club, or whatever,

04:22.100 --> 04:28.680
but are you going to hand over the artwork to the violence and censorship of the Cleansing Committee?

04:28.680 --> 04:31.680
Countering violence with violence

04:31.680 --> 04:34.360
only makes matters worse!

04:34.360 --> 04:35.480
Yeah?

04:35.480 --> 04:38.820
Then do you have a specific plan to approach them?

04:40.780 --> 04:43.720
We are making that effort as we speak.

04:43.720 --> 04:44.740
Mrs. Curator!

04:44.740 --> 04:48.250
You must be the captain of the Task Force, LSTC Genda.

04:48.250 --> 04:51.710
I am the curator of this Library, Sugawara.

04:51.710 --> 04:53.620
Hello.

04:53.620 --> 04:57.920
By the way, I don't see any Defense personnel stationed here.

04:57.920 --> 05:02.890
Discussion is our top priority, so I have not deployed them.

05:03.980 --> 05:06.690
What's going on, Lieutenant Commander Yokota?

05:07.250 --> 05:11.580
The curator, Sugawara, is the special adviser to the Non-Violence Club.

05:11.580 --> 05:13.910
We can't possibly chase them off.

05:13.910 --> 05:17.930
But still, we can't ignore them.

05:17.930 --> 05:23.430
To be unable to arm ourselves without the permission of the curator and administrative staff... it's unheard of!

05:23.430 --> 05:27.380
Haven't you reported the situation to Commander Inamine?

05:27.380 --> 05:29.270
It's useless.

05:29.270 --> 05:32.240
Any messages will be intercepted by the curator.

05:32.240 --> 05:35.370
This place is run by the curator, Sugawara.

05:36.980 --> 05:39.340
This is worse than what Shibasaki told us.

05:39.340 --> 05:45.400
The Library and the Base usually cooperate.

05:45.400 --> 05:46.400
Kasahara.

05:46.400 --> 05:47.340
Yes?

05:47.340 --> 05:50.240
You're going to be the only girl in the dorm.

05:50.240 --> 05:52.840
Be wary of the situation; avoid trouble.

05:52.840 --> 05:54.810
Call me on your cell if anything happens.

05:55.360 --> 05:56.280
Yes, Sir.

05:57.350 --> 06:01.080
The staircase is just around the corner.

06:01.080 --> 06:02.470
Thank you.

06:05.990 --> 06:08.110
You must be Kasahara.

06:08.110 --> 06:10.140
We'll take them to your room.

06:10.140 --> 06:12.550
It's really not much work for me, though.

06:12.550 --> 06:14.500
Don't hold back!

06:14.500 --> 06:16.040
You're our guest!

06:16.040 --> 06:17.790
Okay, then...

06:17.790 --> 06:19.000
But how do you know my name?

06:19.000 --> 06:24.510
Everyone knows about the first ever female Task Force member!

06:25.210 --> 06:28.300
Oh my, this is so heavy!

06:28.300 --> 06:31.630
I'm sorry, I don't think we can do it.

06:31.630 --> 06:35.640
You're so special that you can carry them all by yourself!

06:36.730 --> 06:40.600
Hey, stop leaving the trash out here.

06:40.600 --> 06:42.190
Trash, you say?

06:42.190 --> 06:45.430
This is quite a warm welcome!

06:45.430 --> 06:47.160
We're sorry!

06:47.160 --> 06:49.750
We'll handle the rest.

06:49.750 --> 06:51.660
I'm sorry for not coming down sooner.

06:51.660 --> 06:54.140
I'm Nonomiya Shizuka of the Defense Force.

06:54.140 --> 06:56.130
That's my roommate, Inoue.

06:56.130 --> 06:59.220
The section supervisor has asked us to assist you.

06:59.220 --> 07:01.090
Oh, don't worry, I can do that myself.

07:01.090 --> 07:03.390
Besides, they made the first move.

07:03.390 --> 07:04.710
Yes, but...

07:05.250 --> 07:08.010
I'm sorry, but please don't go against them.

07:12.320 --> 07:16.260
I don't think they're serious about protecting the exhibit!

07:16.260 --> 07:22.060
The reason the Task Force came to assist was because of our insistence.

07:22.060 --> 07:24.020
Right.

07:24.020 --> 07:29.650
We cannot rob the citizens of their right to freely enjoy art.

07:29.650 --> 07:31.990
Please lend us your assistance.

07:31.990 --> 07:35.470
Please tell me if there's anything we can do.

07:37.070 --> 07:40.880
Let's make this exhibit a success.

07:42.400 --> 07:46.330
It's outrageous that the curator is limiting the actions of the Defense Force!

07:46.330 --> 07:51.430
We'll call Commander Inamine immediately and eliminate this nonsensical, local rule.

07:51.430 --> 07:56.120
I'll leave the restoration of the chain of command to Aoki's group.

07:56.120 --> 07:57.430
Get it done today.

07:57.430 --> 08:02.390
All other groups, come up with the most efficient training regimen to be used between now and the exhibition.

08:02.990 --> 08:06.900
Get the local Defense Force members back in shape.

08:06.900 --> 08:10.010
Train those who haven't done any target practice for years?

08:10.010 --> 08:11.990
The exhibition is less than two weeks away!

08:13.070 --> 08:14.820
Enough whining!

08:14.820 --> 08:16.990
You're the Task Force, for crying out loud!

08:16.990 --> 08:20.080
Do your best to get Mito back in shape!

08:21.470 --> 08:23.450
Why is she here?

08:23.450 --> 08:24.820
Scandalous.

08:24.820 --> 08:26.000
Who does she think she is?

08:27.150 --> 08:28.420
She looked this way!

08:28.420 --> 08:29.370
Scary!

08:29.370 --> 08:30.520
Excuse me!

08:30.520 --> 08:33.380
I'm sorry for not explaining.

08:33.380 --> 08:34.910
Excuse me.

08:34.910 --> 08:36.930
Eh, what's going on?

08:36.930 --> 08:40.400
The administrative staff gets their meals and baths first?

08:40.400 --> 08:41.580
I'm sorry.

08:41.580 --> 08:45.160
Here, the Defense personnel have the lowest priority.

08:45.160 --> 08:48.120
The Operations Officer has more power than the Lieutenant Commander.

08:48.120 --> 08:50.610
That's ridiculous.

08:50.610 --> 08:56.580
What happened at the staircase was something of a initiation ceremony for all incoming Defense personnel.

08:56.580 --> 08:58.050
That doesn't make sense!

08:58.050 --> 08:59.630
Why do you sit and take it?

08:59.630 --> 09:05.630
It's better for the men, but there are ninety female administrative staff, and only fifteen of us.

09:05.630 --> 09:08.210
The turnover rate is already high.

09:08.210 --> 09:11.910
If we resist too much, the existence of the Defense Force itself will be in danger.

09:19.490 --> 09:22.600
There, straighten your back.

09:22.600 --> 09:24.230
Support the grip tightly.

09:24.230 --> 09:27.010
Honestly, how good are they?

09:27.010 --> 09:29.780
They are at Kasahara's level, on average.

09:29.780 --> 09:32.790
Back when she joined the Force, or now?

09:32.790 --> 09:34.220
Now, just barely.

09:34.220 --> 09:36.480
Then they'll barely be useful.

09:36.480 --> 09:38.700
Get them to their limit!

09:38.700 --> 09:41.160
Why are you comparing them to me?

09:43.120 --> 09:46.920
By the way, your home is close, isn't it?

09:46.920 --> 09:48.210
Do you plan to visit them?

09:48.210 --> 09:49.490
Absolutely not!

09:49.490 --> 09:55.380
I have conservative parents. They'd make me quit if they found out I'm in the Defense Force.

09:55.380 --> 09:57.550
I see...

10:02.810 --> 10:05.100
What a dirty trick...

10:05.100 --> 10:06.770
I'll go visit the Library.

10:08.500 --> 10:11.070
We're used to it.

10:11.070 --> 10:14.300
And there's no proof that the administrative staff did this.

10:14.300 --> 10:16.780
It's clear who did it, even without proof!

10:16.780 --> 10:18.310
Why are you holding back?

10:18.310 --> 10:20.030
Isn't this vexing?

10:20.030 --> 10:21.320
It is!

10:22.250 --> 10:23.860
I'm sorry.

10:23.860 --> 10:26.540
But this is the only time it's been so bad.

10:27.730 --> 10:34.010
Once the exhibition is over and you go back to Tokyo, it'll be better.

10:34.010 --> 10:38.260
Please don't take away our place.

10:45.250 --> 10:47.050
How are things going over there?

10:47.050 --> 10:48.980
Piece of cake.

10:48.980 --> 10:49.850
Okay.

10:49.850 --> 10:50.910
Don't push yourself.

10:50.910 --> 10:52.460
Aye-aye, Sir!

10:55.480 --> 10:58.420
I'll deal with it myself.

11:10.210 --> 11:11.940
Excuse me!

11:11.940 --> 11:14.190
Please open the door!

11:14.190 --> 11:15.640
That's odd.

11:15.640 --> 11:18.340
I gave them the key since they told me they were the last ones.

11:59.470 --> 12:02.430
Be wary of the situation; avoid trouble.

12:02.430 --> 12:04.620
I know, but...

12:04.620 --> 12:07.970
We're all Library Force members, but why are we treated...

12:23.840 --> 12:25.920
There goes the righteous hero.

12:25.920 --> 12:28.930
She's so uncool, getting all excited like that.

12:53.080 --> 12:56.810
We just came to get the laundry, and...

12:56.810 --> 12:58.540
It wasn't us!

13:00.150 --> 13:01.510
I know.

13:01.510 --> 13:05.540
I'm fine, so go on.

13:05.540 --> 13:06.470
But...

13:06.470 --> 13:08.170
It's okay.

13:08.170 --> 13:11.190
It's better not to be seen with me.

13:17.150 --> 13:18.640
It's okay.

13:20.460 --> 13:22.740
I'm fine.

13:26.930 --> 13:29.090
Hey, you.

13:29.090 --> 13:31.770
What are you doing out so late?

13:37.590 --> 13:43.020
Seeing you every day makes me forget that people like that exist.

13:43.020 --> 13:50.620
If I was in this situation and working in that environment, I might be doing the same thing as well.

13:50.620 --> 13:51.900
You wouldn't.

13:51.900 --> 13:54.610
You can't be sure.

13:54.610 --> 13:55.880
I can.

13:55.880 --> 13:57.850
I've been watching you the whole time.

14:00.750 --> 14:01.740
What happened here?

14:03.950 --> 14:05.340
Sorry.

14:07.200 --> 14:08.800
I'm sorry,

14:08.800 --> 14:12.110
but please give me the usual.

14:35.970 --> 14:38.560
So, did you find her weakness?

14:38.560 --> 14:41.310
Give me some useful info.

14:46.890 --> 14:54.080
CL Kasahara of the Kanto Library Force, please report to the library lobby.

15:01.590 --> 15:03.510
Why...

15:03.510 --> 15:04.930
You!

15:07.430 --> 15:09.360
You took this job without telling us!

15:09.360 --> 15:10.780
Wait! Why...

15:10.780 --> 15:11.870
We're going home!

15:11.870 --> 15:12.990
Don't do this!

15:12.990 --> 15:14.240
I'm still working!

15:14.240 --> 15:16.360
Quit this dangerous job right now!

15:18.180 --> 15:25.040
If you dislike me so much, disown me and get an ideal daughter somewhere else!

15:28.210 --> 15:29.900
Kasahara, that's enough.

15:29.900 --> 15:31.240
It draws too much attention here.

15:35.840 --> 15:37.160
No.

15:37.160 --> 15:39.520
There's nothing to talk to her about.

15:39.520 --> 15:41.190
That's what she always does!

15:41.190 --> 15:44.440
She cries, and she makes me feel guilty.

15:45.520 --> 15:47.110
Calm down!

15:50.510 --> 15:52.740
Do you have your cell phone on you?

15:53.950 --> 15:54.950
Yes.

15:54.950 --> 15:57.610
Where does your father work?

15:57.610 --> 15:59.320
At the prefecture office.

15:59.320 --> 16:00.700
That's nearby.

16:00.700 --> 16:03.630
Call him and ask him to come and get your mother.

16:03.630 --> 16:06.420
You want me to have another fight?

16:06.420 --> 16:07.890
Your father will understand.

16:10.770 --> 16:14.160
Face it head on, and put an end to the whole thing!

16:15.480 --> 16:17.510
Give me a report later.

16:17.510 --> 16:18.380
Yes, Sir.

16:20.510 --> 16:22.480
I know it's my fault for not telling you,

16:22.480 --> 16:28.760
but I tried so hard, and now I'm being recognized to an extent.

16:28.760 --> 16:30.860
What good does this job do?

16:30.860 --> 16:35.110
Iku was the first girl in the entire country to be chosen by the Task Force.

16:35.110 --> 16:36.760
That's great.

16:36.760 --> 16:38.700
What do you mean?

16:38.700 --> 16:40.470
How do you know that?

16:40.470 --> 16:44.440
Her photo was in a magazine, and I could tell from that.

16:44.440 --> 16:46.930
Let's acknowledge her effort.

16:46.930 --> 16:48.350
Don't be ridiculous!

16:48.350 --> 16:50.860
Are you going to kill Iku again?

16:50.860 --> 16:51.730
Again?

16:51.730 --> 16:53.720
Don't be so extreme.

16:53.720 --> 16:54.870
I will!

16:54.870 --> 16:58.130
Your carefree attitude made her fall off the cliff!

16:58.130 --> 16:59.790
That's why... the bald spot!

16:59.790 --> 17:01.850
The bald spot is your fault!

17:01.850 --> 17:03.420
Wait, dear!

17:03.420 --> 17:04.820
Cliff?

17:04.820 --> 17:05.880
Bald spot?

17:05.880 --> 17:09.060
Remember when we had a large rock behind our house?

17:09.060 --> 17:15.020
When you were small, we were pretending to rock climb.

17:30.650 --> 17:33.410
That bald spot on our precious daughter is your fault!

17:33.410 --> 17:35.960
But fortunately, she only needed three stitches.

17:35.960 --> 17:37.880
You're too irresponsible!

17:37.880 --> 17:42.800
If... if anything had happened to Iku...

17:42.800 --> 17:44.350
Mom...

17:45.060 --> 17:48.320
I thought you hated me.

17:48.320 --> 17:50.840
You're the one who hates me.

17:50.840 --> 17:51.780
Dummy...

17:51.780 --> 17:53.450
I don't.

17:53.450 --> 17:57.380
You're scary, and a bit overprotective,

17:57.380 --> 18:01.750
but I've always wanted you to like me.

18:02.460 --> 18:04.200
Me too.

18:06.090 --> 18:07.630
Mom...

18:11.290 --> 18:12.930
I see.

18:12.930 --> 18:15.900
This is how they found out about my house.

18:15.900 --> 18:17.950
I'm sorry.

18:17.950 --> 18:19.650
I'm sorry as well.

18:23.030 --> 18:24.530
It's not your fault.

18:24.530 --> 18:26.990
Let's fix your habit of apologizing.

18:26.990 --> 18:29.250
I understand everything now. It's okay.

18:29.250 --> 18:31.710
Kasahara...

18:31.710 --> 18:35.400
I'm the guilty one for talking too much about myself.

18:35.400 --> 18:40.680
I should have known that the administrative staff would force you to tell them about me.

18:40.680 --> 18:42.060
But...

18:42.060 --> 18:46.150
I need to face it head on, or nothing will change!

18:46.150 --> 18:49.060
I'll show you how grown-ups fight.

18:51.340 --> 18:54.200
I'm not targeting anyone in particular, but I'll declare this to you.

18:54.200 --> 19:01.080
I already know how and because of whom yesterday's incident came to be.

19:01.080 --> 19:04.910
I will let it pass as yet another disagreement among girls.

19:04.910 --> 19:06.690
But I'm drawing a line here.

19:06.690 --> 19:09.840
If anything happens to the Defense Force,

19:09.840 --> 19:16.110
I will write a report declaring this as interference by internal staff against the prefecture exhibit.

19:16.110 --> 19:25.040
I'm certain everyone knows that your performance reviews go to the Kanto Library Base, right?

19:25.040 --> 19:31.250
Just remember, I will be going back to the central office of the Kanto Library Force.

19:44.570 --> 19:45.850
Um...

19:45.850 --> 19:54.300
Anyone outside of the administrative staff can use the cafeteria, the bath, and this room whenever they wish.

19:54.300 --> 19:55.780
What's that?

19:55.780 --> 19:58.860
You think that's a proper apology?

19:58.860 --> 19:59.910
Kasahara-san!

19:59.910 --> 20:02.890
Let us say this.

20:04.320 --> 20:09.790
We have no time to accept your apology right before the exhibition.

20:09.790 --> 20:13.850
We only want to use the facilities around the dormitory fairly.

20:13.850 --> 20:17.520
And we just want to live here with equal status.

20:17.520 --> 20:19.520
We are not asking for any special treatment.

20:22.950 --> 20:24.700
Well done.

20:30.210 --> 20:32.920
But I...

20:32.920 --> 20:34.430
I won't hear any excuses.

20:34.430 --> 20:38.590
I'll ask you to do a follow-up on the situation once we're done here.

21:06.790 --> 21:10.130
I had a feeling something was about to change

21:10.130 --> 21:13.510
nani mo kawaranu asa ni

21:10.130 --> 21:13.510
on this very ordinary morning

21:13.510 --> 21:18.520
itsu mo yori sukoshi ii mezamedatta

21:13.510 --> 21:18.520
I woke up feeling a little better than usual

21:20.180 --> 21:26.860
hito sashiyubi de sashimesu no wa mirai

21:20.180 --> 21:26.860
My index finger points out to the future

21:26.860 --> 21:36.530
kimi no te no hira ga fureru tabi ni afuru omoi

21:26.860 --> 21:36.530
My thoughts overflow each time I touch your palm

21:36.980 --> 21:40.510
ch-ch-ch-changes saa kawatteku

21:36.980 --> 21:40.510
Changes, yeah. I'm changing.

21:40.510 --> 21:43.830
sayonara furui jibun

21:40.510 --> 21:43.830
Goodbye my old self

21:43.830 --> 21:50.360
shingenjitsu atarashii nani ka ga matteru

21:43.830 --> 21:50.360
There's something new awaiting me in the new reality

21:50.360 --> 21:54.100
ch-ch-ch-changes saa kawatteku

21:50.360 --> 21:54.100
Changes, yeah. I'm changing.

21:54.100 --> 21:57.330
ushinau mono mo aru

21:54.100 --> 21:57.330
There are things I'll lose too

21:57.330 --> 22:03.100
